    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/e49d78-3/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=519288784416670510&sectionId=519288784785769262)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"off_lazy_script"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggH3Z11_Xhc_text","label":"ggH3Z11_Xhc_text","default":"Frequently asked questions"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_0","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_0","default":"<p>What is Shilajit?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_1","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_1","default":"<p>Why is Gold Trace important to Shilajit Resin?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_2","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_2","default":"<p>Is this pure? Do Wellness Nest have lab tests? Is this third party tested for harmful metals?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_3","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_3","default":"<p>What country is this manufactured in?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_4","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_4","default":"<p>Is this Shilajit sourced from high altitude (&gt;17,000 ft)?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_5","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_5","default":"<p>How long will I feel effective?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_6","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_6","default":"<p>How do I know if Shilajit is right for me?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_7","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_7","default":"<p>What does Shilajit taste like?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_8","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_8","default":"<p>How often should I take Shilajit?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_9","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_9","default":"<p>Can women use Shilajit?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_10","label":"ggyPvX-7RJg_childItem_10","default":"<p>Does Shilajit help with stress and anxiety?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBPrG0AB_o_text","label":"ggBPrG0AB_o_text","default":"<p>Shilajit is a natural substance found mainly in the Himalayas, formed for centuries by the gradual decomposition of certain plants by the action of microorganisms. It is a potent and very safe dietary supplement, restoring energetic balance and potentially improving vitality, with a rich history of use in Ayurvedic medicine.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoaMdTpVep_text","label":"ggoaMdTpVep_text","default":"<p>Gold trace elements in Shilajit are believed to enhance its natural properties by promoting better health and wellness. Gold is known for its anti-inflammatory and joint-supporting benefits, making the Shilajit resin even more effective in supporting overall health.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXFUyuilUW_text","label":"ggXFUyuilUW_text","default":"<p>Yes, our Pure Himalayan Shilajit is of the highest purity. Wellness Nest ensures rigorous quality control by conducting extensive lab tests, including third-party testing for harmful metals and contaminants to guarantee safety and effectiveness.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDzLoXZfXO_text","label":"ggDzLoXZfXO_text","default":"<p>Our Shilajit is sourced and manufactured in Jammu and Kashmir, India, utilizing traditional methods that preserve its natural qualities and potency.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg90RRI2jcv_text","label":"gg90RRI2jcv_text","default":"<p>Absolutely, our Shilajit is sourced from regions in the Himalayas that are over 17,000 feet in altitude. This high altitude ensures that the Shilajit is of the best quality, harvested from areas where the environment contributes to the substance's unique properties.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKaG1pkD6b_text","label":"ggKaG1pkD6b_text","default":"<p>The effects of Shilajit can vary from person to person. Most users begin to notice benefits like increased energy and improved mental clarity almost immediately to within a few days of daily usage. For optimal benefits, regular use for at least a couple of months is recommended.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtJ_pAUxmO_text","label":"ggtJ_pAUxmO_text","default":"<p>If you are looking for a natural supplement to enhance your overall vitality, boost your energy levels, and support your body’s nutrient absorption, Shilajit might be suitable for you. However, consulting with a healthcare professional before starting any new supplement regimen is always recommended.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR1mRZOleX_text","label":"ggR1mRZOleX_text","default":"<p>Shilajit has a distinct, slightly bitter taste with a smoky flavor. The taste can vary slightly based on the source and processing method.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnHMx0JEQw_text","label":"ggnHMx0JEQw_text","default":"<p>It is generally recommended to take Shilajit once or twice daily, depending on the concentration and the desired health benefits. Follow the specific dosage instructions provided with your Shilajit product.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaEhPv5Sbu_text","label":"ggaEhPv5Sbu_text","default":"<p>Yes, Shilajit is beneficial for both men and women. Women can take it to enhance energy levels, improve skin health, and support nutrient metabolism.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglqqqzdQ5r_text","label":"gglqqqzdQ5r_text","default":"<p>Yes, due to its adaptogenic properties, Shilajit can help the body manage stress and reduce anxiety by modulating the release of stress hormones in the body.</p>"}],
